1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,136
Narrator: Scenario 9. Global meeting communication.

2
00:00:05,736 --> 00:00:15,600
B: Can you confirm the service will be back within thirty minutes? Our operations team needs to decide whether to activate the manual order process.

3
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:27,024
A: We do not have a reliable recovery estimate yet. We are validating a mitigation, but we have not confirmed that it restores successful order processing.

4
00:00:27,624 --> 00:00:37,272
B: What does validating mean in this case? The dashboard looks better than it did ten minutes ago, so people are expecting a quick recovery.

5
00:00:37,872 --> 00:00:47,856
A: The error rate has decreased, but some orders still time out. We need to check completed orders and payment status, not only server health.

6
00:00:48,456 --> 00:00:56,496
B: If you cannot give a recovery time, what information can I use to decide whether our staff should switch to the manual process?

7
00:00:57,096 --> 00:01:08,160
A: I can provide the current failure rate, affected functions, and trend. Your team should apply the documented business continuity criteria using those facts.

8
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:20,136
B: Our procedure says to consider manual handling after twenty minutes of sustained order failures. We have reached that point, but duplicate orders are a concern.

9
00:01:20,736 --> 00:01:32,904
A: Please coordinate with the order owner before entering replacements. A timed-out request may still complete, so reconciliation is necessary before retrying or manually recreating it.

10
00:01:33,504 --> 00:01:41,952
B: Understood. When will you know more about the mitigation, and how will you tell us if the recovery estimate remains uncertain?

11
00:01:42,552 --> 00:01:54,048
A: We will update you by 14:30 UTC, even if there is no confirmed estimate. The update will include validation results and any change in business impact.

12
00:01:54,648 --> 00:02:02,952
B: I will have the order owner review the manual procedure now and tell staff that the next update time is not a promised recovery time.

13
00:02:03,552 --> 00:02:13,416
A: Thank you. I own the technical update and will notify you earlier if impact worsens or we confirm that normal order processing has recovered.
